  "title": "IP Telephony and VoIP Server with Asterisk PBX on Linux",
  "excerpt": "Configuring a private PBX telephone exchange with Asterisk, provisioning SIP users and extensions, defining dialplan routing in extensions.conf, and running softphone tests.",
  "tags": ["linux", "voip", "asterisk", "sip", "telefonia-ip", "archivo-2020"],
